      "UsesAmmoSameLocationOnly"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Ultralight Backstabber",
  "YangsThoughts": "As House Marik was running low of funds after the long fighting of the Reunification War they tried to find new ways to cut costs. The Apollon was born from once such project, creating a cheap 15 ton ultralight 'Mech. The design was never liked by the armed forces of the Free Worlds League due to its obvious cost-cutting measures, but although most of the produced 'Mechs have been lost as the years passed a surprising amount has somehow still stayed relevant and even found their way to other Great Houses.",
